summary:
Continued economic pressure on Iran might not just crush its economy. It could threaten the regime's political survival too.

@JSchanzer joins @FoxNews to analyze the latest U.S. sanctions against Iran and whether Trump's pressure campaign could bring down the regime.

📺: https://t.co/zLk07tjQY1

Economic collapse and political survival aren't the same thing.

@jonathans_tobin  of @JNS_org tells @JSchanzer the Iranian regime could hang on for years out of spite — treating its own survival as vengeance for the war launched against it.

